Try as many things as
possible until you figure out

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:32.820
what you're rad at, and you like

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:34.720
and go (alarm beeps) do that
for the rest of your life

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:36.470
and stop giving a (alarm
beeps) on everybody else.

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:39.183
